desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "javascript"
	title: "Struct scan: JavaScript child_process.exec"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：JavaScript child_process.exec"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-js-child-process-exec"
	risk: "command-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 child_process.exec。它通过 shell 执行命令，外部输入可导致命令注入。

### 风险类型
command-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学原语，若处理外部数据或用于安全场景，可能导致命令执行、代码执行、反序列化或机密性破坏。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 execFile/spawn 并传递参数数组，不要拼接命令字符串。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://app.js": <<<POS
const child_process = require("child_process");
function run(cmd) { child_process.exec(cmd); }

POS
	"safefile://app-safe.js": <<<NEG
function run(cmd) { return cmd; }

NEG
)

child_process.exec(* as $cmd) as $call
child_process.execSync(* as $cmd) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "child_process.exec",
	title_zh: "child_process.exec",
	message: "结构扫描：JavaScript child_process.exec",
	risk: "command-injection",
}
